# FAQ Page Redesign: Enhanced Accordion

We will replace the current grid design of the FAQ page with a premium, high-interaction accordion system based on the one used in the contact page.

## Proposed Changes

### [DetailedFAQ Component]
#### [MODIFY] [DetailedFAQ.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/faq/DetailedFAQ.tsx)
-   Replace the grid layout with a single-column accordion using shadcn/ui components.
-   Integrate category-specific icons.
-   Add enhanced animations and transitions (hover effects, smooth expansion).
-   Include "WhatsApp" quick contact links for each question.

